      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "hiding group instances of groups you have blocked is an absolutely necessary feature at this point, because I also have given up trying my luck with group publics for chill/hangout worlds until something improves. blocking right now barely does anything. \"no invites and you cannot join the group\" yea, no, I want their crappy instances out of my sight.\n\npeople refusing to acknowledge the age verification, harassment not being punished or even coming from the hosts, powertrips. heard or seen it all.\n\nthe only thing I disagree with slightly is a trust or rating system for groups as I can see that being abused, especially if groups have beef over a timeslot or just drama with each other. for that to function properly you'd need to set up enough guardrails against abuse and I honestly don't know how that would work. not to mention that current trust ranks don't really say much about the quality of the person on the account.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
